{"v": 4, "paragraphs": ["Diva do mundo da música, Mariah Carey surgiu nesta sexta-feira (20) relaxando e tomando uma taça de vinho na varanda do Hotel Fasano, no Rio de Janeiro. E ainda com o privilégio de ter a vista da praia de Ipanema, no Rio de Janeiro.", "Toda estilosa, a cantora norte-americana usou um pijama de listras e ainda não abriu mão do óculos escuro. Mariah está no Brasil cumprindo agenda com a turnê \"Mariah Carey's Christmas Time\". Ela já fez o show de São Paulo e, no próximo dia 21, sobe ao palco da Farmasi Arena, no Rio de Janeiro.", "Veja fotos", "+gshow"], "images": ["https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/fwtzh33c6l_p9BDUhqnzqYXwQss=/1920x0/filters:format(jpeg)/https://i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/6/8/qflWnER7auFHAZCFiOwA/montagem-gshow-1-.png", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/4udX34NCJY3B6cw-IyYbqmLDEsY=/0x0:2572x1715/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/E/Z/9JakSMRAiPi1WDObKNlw/mariah-carey-300.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/bW2ulTjF3jocSkxqVHyn4pf_qgg=/0x0:3169x2112/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/e/D/jzltn9SnqYbIB9HLTZwQ/mariah-carey-332.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/IoMQOGb0jfmaA9sYlR59X4jzh7I=/0x0:5013x3342/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/N/a/qzhAJkRZAHexhLith2hA/mariah-carey-320.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/oumBX9UkfIjtuEcK049gLTAT27s=/0x0:2941x1961/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/l/X/SdNGZYQgaUFGkuRigQOw/mariah-carey-312.jpg", "https://s2-gshow.glbimg.com/krovxlK2VKPrT39_vPTqxDmG068=/0x0:1881x2706/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_e84042ef78cb4708aeebdf1c68c6cbd6/internal_photos/bs/2026/t/g/sucRvBQXSoREQiToOA1Q/mariah-carey-318.jpg"], "videos": [{"p